            <ArticleTitle>Pneumatization of the uncinate process.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>361-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report one case of extensive and two of partial pneumatization of the uncinate process from a consecutive series of 250 CT scans of the paranasal sinuses. The CT findings are illustrated and the literature reviewed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
